    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25045" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ischĭas</span></b> , ădis,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχιάς.</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>The</i>
			
			<i>hip-gout</i>, <i>sciatica</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 27, 5,
				16, § 33</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>an herb said to be
				good for the hip-gout;</i> called also leucacantha, <i><span class="en">Plin. 22,
				16, 18, § 40</span></i>.</div>
